+# ============================================================================
+# ⚠ THE SCREEN CALL SITE NEEDS A SEAM OR IT HAS NO POSSIBLE RED
+# ============================================================================
+# draw()'s entire body is inside `if(has_x)` (draw.c:10377), so under --nogui
