+# ============================================================================
+# ⚠ I4 IS MEASURED AS BYTES, NOT AS `git diff`
+# ============================================================================
+# The acceptance cell says "save the file and git diff is EMPTY". A headless
+# row cannot run git against a fixture it just wrote, and `xschem save` may
